  "hash": "e33ab327cbaa81fb199a4c39302888ebf7f7989c7e5f4a7bc0c7fc349d0f80b1",
  "summary": "`aayu ready \u003cfeature\u003e` (human-only) is Approve to build. One approval per Feature agrees its baselines, its budget, and every story listed then (Decision #903). A story is Ready only while that approval covers it. A story added or changed later needs a person's acknowledgment, `aayu ready \u003cfeature\u003e --ack \u003cstories\u003e`. This is steps S8 and S9 of the core design (aayu core: the human-dependency engine, agreed by @rahulnakmol on 2026-10-21). This Feature replaces #878, which #903 folds into it.",
